WEBVTT

00:06:29.534 --> 00:06:31.517
zbog procesa reformisanja
koji se dešavao

00:06:31.517 --> 00:06:33.167
u njihovoj zemlji.

00:06:33.167 --> 00:06:34.837
Ma Tida je rekla:

00:06:34.837 --> 00:06:36.482
"Mi Burmanci smo čuveni

00:06:36.482 --> 00:06:39.954
po velikoj gracioznosti pod pritiskom,

00:06:39.954 --> 00:06:44.287
ali takođe nosimo žalost
ispod glamura,"

00:06:44.287 --> 00:06:46.693
rekla je, "i činjenica da su se desila

00:06:46.693 --> 00:06:48.028
ova pomeranja i promene

00:06:48.028 --> 00:06:50.342
ne briše stalne probleme

00:06:50.342 --> 00:06:51.834
u našem društvu

00:06:51.834 --> 00:06:54.311
na koje smo dobro navikli

00:06:54.311 --> 00:06:56.245
tokom boravka u zatvoru."

00:06:56.245 --> 00:06:58.404
Razumeo sam da je rekla

00:06:58.404 --> 00:07:01.860
da ustupci daju samo malo humanosti,